        <detaileddescription>
<para>Computed as <formula id="36">$(\boldsymbol{\sigma} J_0 w)\, \partial_\mathbf{x} \mathbf{N}$</formula>, a nDim x nNodes matrix of nodal forces (see strainIncrement()). <parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
